{"id":"rose-tmdb-1176962","type":"MOVIE","category":"CINE","title":"Rose","overview":"En medio de la agitación de la Guerra de los Treinta Años, un misterioso soldado aparece en una apartada aldea protestante afirmando ser el heredero de una mansión abandonada hace mucho tiempo. Su búsqueda de reconocimiento y aceptación se ve complicada por un secreto: ha llegado a la aldea bajo una identidad y un nombre falsos, y fingiendo pertenecer a otro género. Sin embargo, Rose —que es el verdadero nombre del soldado— no se detendrá ante nada para lograr sus objetivos.","releaseDate":"2027-01-28","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/flnb7COkqD4dZNZiCacNkai22vz.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/1KUzZMCBOtInUFoGUEJJsQyQKVi.jpg","genres":["Drama","Historia","Bélica"],"originalLanguage":"de","spokenLanguages":["German"],"images":[{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/1KUzZMCBOtInUFoGUEJJsQyQKVi.jpg","label":"Escena 01"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/ewitRaiKieUQOxDkjfie4iy3ulK.jpg","label":"Escena 02"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/wsIdiMH5AhAcT8n1HSUnuShRrmR.jpg","label":"Escena 03"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/wZopgRTrciYX2sb4Tl1TUX2TTAR.jpg","label":"Escena 04"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/1YEhGFepA1M4zZ3btZVqhoA8470.jpg","label":"Escena 05"}],"ratings":{"tmdb":7.7},"availability":{},"cast":[{"name":"Sandra Hüller","role":"Rose","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQfKXVCPTH9KEnzHHU4QemCnlMe.jpg","personTmdbId":7152,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Caro Braun","role":"Suzanna","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMlt1SZ6eOUinOcSTc7QhrlEuuy.jpg","personTmdbId":5926511,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Marisa Growaldt","role":"The Narrator (voice)","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbDsn2cj6ATAL4Su10Usp0R5b4t.jpg","personTmdbId":1817655,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Robert Gwisdek","role":"The Bailiff","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/doCAnt1rXCLmbLlMA9wQx215LSF.jpg"